     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Un año en el extranjero",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "I moved abroad for a year and felt homesick during the first few weeks.",
       "alumno": "Me mudé al extranjero durante un año y eché de menos mi hogar las primeras semanas.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "abroad",
         "en el extranjero"
        ],
        [
         "homesick",
         "con nostalgia de casa"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "I had an argument with my flatmate about the heating, but we sorted it out that evening.",
       "alumno": "Tuve una discusión con mi compañero de piso por la calefacción, pero lo resolvimos esa misma noche.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "argument",
         "discusión"
        ],
        [
         "flatmate",
         "compañero de piso"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "At first, the local customs seemed unusual; gradually, I understood why people followed them.",
       "alumno": "Al principio, las costumbres locales me parecían extrañas; poco a poco entendí por qué la gente las seguía.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "customs",
         "costumbres"
        ],
        [
         "gradually",
         "poco a poco"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "My accommodation was small, although it was close to the station and the embassy.",
       "alumno": "Mi alojamiento era pequeño, aunque estaba cerca de la estación y de la embajada.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "accommodation",
         "alojamiento"
        ],
        [
         "embassy",
         "embajada"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "I mainly studied in the mornings and worked in a café in the evenings.",
       "alumno": "Estudiaba sobre todo por las mañanas y trabajaba en una cafetería por las tardes.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "mainly",
         "sobre todo"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "I made friends with a neighbour who helped me settle in and understand the city.",
       "alumno": "Entablé amistad con una vecina que me ayudó a instalarme y adaptarme a la ciudad.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "settle in",
         "adaptarse e instalarse"
        ],
        [
         "made friends",
         "entablé amistad"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "By the end of the year, the place felt familiar, though I still missed my family.",
       "alumno": "Al acabar el año, aquel lugar ya me resultaba familiar, aunque todavía echaba de menos a mi familia.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "familiar",
         "familiar"
        ],
        [
         "missed",
         "echaba de menos"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Living overseas was challenging, but it gave me a better understanding of the culture.",
       "alumno": "Vivir en el extranjero fue todo un reto, pero me ayudó a comprender mejor la cultura.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
